00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,820
Read a simple A2 travel article about renting and driving a car in Japan.

2
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:15,300
Learn what documents tourists may need, what to ask at the rental counter, and how to drive safely on Japanese roads.

3
