8
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:35,060
At the rental counter

9
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:36,180
Good morning.

10
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:38,520
Welcome to Sakura Rent-a-Car.

11
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:39,640
How can I help you?

12
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:40,100
Hi.

13
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:44,040
I have a reservation under Ogino.

14
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:45,440
Thank you.

15
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:48,420
May I see your passport and driving documents?

16
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:49,440
Sure.

17
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:53,120
Here is my passport and my International Driving Permit.

18
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:54,160
Thank you.

19
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:57,780
This permit is the booklet type.

20
00:00:57,780 --> 00:00:59,880
It is valid for Japan.

21
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:00,840
Great.

22
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,360
What insurance is included?

23
00:01:04,720 --> 00:01:06,020
Basic insurance is included.

24
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:08,980
You can add extra coverage for accidents.

25
00:01:09,320 --> 00:01:10,220
I see.

26
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:12,980
Does this car have ETC for toll roads?

27
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:14,780
Yes, it has ETC.

28
00:01:15,020 --> 00:01:17,280
You can rent an ETC card from us.

29
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:17,890
Good.

30
00:01:18,520 --> 00:01:20,660
Should I return the car with a full tank?

31
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:24,820
Yes, please return it with a full tank and bring the receipt.

32
00:01:25,380 --> 00:01:27,460
What time should I return it on Sunday?

33
00:01:27,460 --> 00:01:30,440
Please return it by 6 p.m.

34
00:01:30,740 --> 00:01:33,400
Before I leave, can we check the scratches together?

35
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:34,460
Of course.

36
00:01:34,660 --> 00:01:36,940
Let's check the car together now.

37
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:37,820
Thank you.

38
00:01:38,080 --> 00:01:40,260
I will drive slowly at first.

39
