58
00:02:19,780 --> 00:02:24,260
Driving in Japan can be useful outside big cities, but preparation is important.

59
00:02:24,260 --> 00:02:27,580
Check your permit or translation before travel.

60
00:02:28,160 --> 00:02:32,960
At the rental counter, ask about insurance, fuel, tolls, and return time.

61
00:02:33,580 --> 00:02:40,320
On the road, drive on the left, wear a seat belt, and park only in allowed places.

62
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:41,500
Good work.

63
00:02:42,140 --> 00:02:47,460
Ask one clear question, repeat the important words, and move when your next step is clear.
